---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="YouTube Embed Alternative" seo={{ page_description: "Why you should stop using YouTube embeds on your website." }}>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 prose">
    <h1>The YouTube Embed Alternative</h1>
    <p class="lead">YouTube is great for discovery, but embedding YouTube videos on your website is actively harming your brand and leaking your traffic.</p>

    <h2>The problem with YouTube embeds</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Traffic leakage:</strong> YouTube's primary goal is to keep users on YouTube. The player is covered in links designed to pull viewers away from your site.</li>
      <li><strong>"Related Videos":</strong> At the end of your video, YouTube often recommends your competitors' content. You cannot turn this off.</li>
      <li><strong>Branding:</strong> You cannot remove the YouTube logo or customize the player colors.</li>
      <li><strong>Ads:</strong> Depending on settings and copyright claims, your visitors might see ads before your video plays.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>uVideoPlayer: 100% Yours</h2>
    <p>We built uVideoPlayer to be the exact opposite of a YouTube embed. It's a clean, fast, HTML5 video player that respects your audience and keeps them on your page.</p>

    <ul>
      <li>No ads, ever.</li>
      <li>No related videos.</li>
      <li>Zero branding (not even our own).</li>
      <li>Customizable colors to match your site.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="mt-12 bg-[var(--color-bg-base)] p-8 rounded border border-[var(--color-border)] not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Reclaim your traffic</h3>
      <p class="mb-6 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Embed your first video in minutes.</p>
      <a href="/pricing/" class="inline-block rounded bg-[var(--color-primary)] px-5 py-3 font-medium text-white hover:bg-[var(--color-primary-dark)]">Start Free Trial</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
